 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.36-test.1] - 2026-11-26
+
+> R49 identity-boundary hardening candidate. No E2LB/iAP2 connection fix claimed.
+
+- Treat missing, malformed, or mismatched Pair-Verify receiver identity fields as untrusted identity failures; stop retry/fallback paths.
+- Validate receiver identifiers as bounded, strict UTF-8 without control characters; log only a stable SHA-256 fingerprint.
+- Add regression cases for malformed Pair-Verify M2 fields, identity mismatch, malformed UTF-8, and log injection.
+- 将 Pair-Verify 缺失、畸形或不匹配的接收端身份统一视为不可信身份，停止重试及降级路径。
+- 对接收端标识进行长度、严格 UTF-8 和控制字符校验；日志只输出 SHA-256 指纹，避免原始标识泄露及日志注入。
+- 增加 Pair-Verify M2 畸形字段、身份不匹配、非法 UTF-8 和日志注入回归测试。
+
 ## [v0.1.35-test.1] - 2026-11-26
 
 > R48 hardening candidate. AirPlay identity verification now fails closed without a verified receiver key; no E2LB vehicle fix claimed.
